OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry with lots of strong
OL,6,Fsunshine, temperatures rising rapidly
OL,7,Fduring the morning. High level cloud
OL,8,Fwill make the skies a little hazy
OL,9,Facross the north of the region at
OL,10,Ftimes. Feeling hot, locally very hot.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FPlenty of evening sunshine
OL,13,Fand then dry overnight with prolonged
OL,14,Fclear periods and variable cloud.
OL,15,FStaying warm in urban areas with light
OL,16,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,168,160,301,260,100,100
