OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FTemperatures rising quickly
OL,6,Funder strong sunshine. Feeling hot or
OL,7,Flocally very hot. As a result, an
OL,8,Famber extreme heat warning has been
OL,9,Fissued, and this covers part of the
OL,10,Fregion.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloudier
OL,13,Fand fresher from Friday with sunny
OL,14,Fspells and perhaps the odd shower on
OL,15,FSaturday. Dry with sunny spells on
OL,16,FSunday, before clouding over from the
OL,17,Fwest late afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
